      "type": "list_item",
      "text": "Rogue Trooper"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Duncan Jones brings the beloved 2000 AD comic strip to life with an all-guns-blazing sci-fi animation, about a soldier in a dystopian future who is sent on an impossible mission."
